  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-learns-to-swim-v5.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "5ce882c5b78f750e607a78d7c43f99a2818498b8718927bffeac92cae08b2ddd",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6269a2a2e31cd91d1c91629beb119269daf069c7e55f55f5ffa87f5fa560d385",
      "text": "Wukong Learns\nto Swim",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3656f7a243ea32eb92301de3724a7b9302319a2cc355d812e23dcf70d0a17dd0",
      "text": "Ao Bing swims beside the\ncoach.\n“I want to swim, too!” says\nWukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a03d43a36bc54b6dd3a03bcea986c2a8be18ca9fd8276a7872ef2450e2fd1609",
      "text": "Wukong stops at the edge.\n“I feel a little scared.”\n“We can go slowly,” says the\ncoach.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "24e521d646362ed0e09d055e066a7700dc2e98c3c2c535393a324b9b035f9adc",
      "text": "Sandy sits close to the pool.\nThe coach holds out a hand.\n“Ready?” Wukong nods.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a6615abcd5add58a891e30ce478684efb73c4d19dd4d4ee65947603d05b52052",
      "text": "Wukong holds the pool edge.\nThe coach stays right beside\nhim.\nAo Bing makes a tiny splash.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bb06a2fecbdddc85b5db310f02921396f861582cbc26df1f625938f62bf7b594",
      "text": "Three toys bob in the pool.\nA shark, a starfish, a\nclownfish!\n“Hello, little fish!” says\nWukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "242d4c903957cc7571c762436e24de3b779e4a53d9a8211bf47713de5679980d",
      "text": "The coach lifts a foam\nbarbell.\nIt has big blue ends.\n“Do fish lift weights?” asks\nWukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fbf6653dabe37fef7d0866416dda8c13380ee4230a44a7ba9e84b11794a7d33e",
      "text": "“This one helps us practice.”\nWukong grins, but holds the\nedge.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "aea13fd160cb3cf0709baf15e27189c98d740708023f237191f77fc7b047045e",
      "text": "The coach blows little\nbubbles.\nWukong tries to blow bubbles,\ntoo.\nPop, pop, pop!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2cb9abed217a03ca45fbb2a8cfceac3594adbcfd38f910d4231b2613b1e7b5f4",
      "text": "Water tickles his chin.\nHe lifts his face and blinks.\n“A little rest,” says the\ncoach.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2ad4e9b4dff9f3a082d8577ea1a6354a8770d489ca08cda1f95fe6a6ddc28960",
      "text": "Wukong comes back for\nanother lesson.\nHe makes more bubbles at the\nedge.\n“My bubbles are back!” he\nsays.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3fe8c9d616e1c3599fabec75347dcf044a37b74c530e9a0686816766c2322ba3",
      "text": "“Can you help me float?”\n“Yes,” says the coach.\n“I am holding you.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0596800464e57f94757d2e3e1df2bb30f1668e45b665c8f9b8e296e8b9ca17d1",
      "text": "Wukong starts to float with\nhelp.\nHis belly bobs like a boat.\n“A boat with a tail!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5c50d6d6755921dc9749571326f102f06eaa897e91e725329a28064e2e6ead2d",
      "text": "At another lesson, Wukong\ntries little kicks.\n“Legs straight. Knees soft.”\nWukong stretches his legs\nbehind him.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "250b262efb00719f538bf912769e3f87f2b982d9c9939f7f99497ab64e47d467",
      "text": "“Soft knees. Little kicks.”\nHis feet make small splashes.\n“The shark is watching!” says\nAo Bing.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "45cc84a3e7ffb9099b3cbccb6bfd8c03b8372b96fcb40beacba62d560cd0d2a2",
      "text": "Wukong holds the foam\nbarbell. “Head down. Look\ninto the water.” He blows\nbubbles and kicks. The coach\nsupports him.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "563fd398aebbce30b3c398fa79c8cfea3c3c2a22bef297269c46a012c683d056",
      "text": "More lessons.\nHe puts the barbell down.\n“You are right here?”\n“Right here,” says the coach.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3578f60a2f5ec81743bccbd9df420796fa37fba07aec82ff5896c6022e1c0df2",
      "text": "He swims a little way.\nThe coach stays within reach.\nWukong turns to hold the pool\nedge.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-19.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "950eaf8a6e4e556bc6ad895697eb3b5de6866504573ef1f2194de56ea6afd94c",
      "text": "“I swam a little way!” says\nWukong.\n“You did!” says Ao Bing.\nThe coach helps Wukong out.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-20.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a0cb6268408cc9f565bab861e2fc8c4eda80baf602424d69b12e6dbde21bc12b",
      "text": "Three toys go in the basket.\n“Good night, little shark.”\n“You had a busy lesson, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-21.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b6f14abd05c0cd0e1ecc06a7a775d666ab6e243347598fcce36a91498c2c38c0",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed this story, you are welcome\nto support more. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStory and art made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
